  "validationNotes": {
    "coverage": "77 focused tests include four actual paid evolutions at both seats, exact own-civilization grants including source itself, native attack/summoning/ignore/seal restrictions, independent simultaneous grants and original tap options, real eight-mana native tap cost isolation, current-turn power expiry, target protection, mandatory top ramp with multicolor and Ningyo, controller blind discard, all physical IDs and encrypted restoration. Eight tests execute the real createDuelService/projectRoom/sealRoom move path. 211 selected tap, Fort, gear and blind-discard regressions and five online regressions pass.",
    "resolvedAttempts": "Initial tests used Giga Slug as an attacking recipient, but its printed no-attack ability correctly prohibited activation; use Bone Assassin as eligible Dark recipient, retaining Giga Slug as legal Chimera evolution base. Later service assertions treated the intentionally text-only projected decision as the raw engine choice array; corrected assertions check opaque projected actions with no hidden IDs. Production behavior was correct in both cases.",
    "reprints": "All four official name searches returned exactly the original DM06 print. Full original card images reviewed, no linked direct QA returned; native tap/evolution/target/movement rule interactions reproduced in focused and related tests."
